    <string name="data_storage">Kubika amakuru</string>
    <string name="data_storage_intro">Retro Player igumana igenamiterere rya porogaramu muri database ntoya yo mu gace utuyemo. Umuziki wawe n\'urutonde rw\'indirimbo zawe biguma nk\'amadosiye asanzwe muri dosiye wahisemo.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_title">Ububiko bw\'amakuru bwa porogaramu</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_body">Dosiye: %1$s\nInzira: %2$s\n\nIbika imizi y\'isomero, imiterere yo kureba, CV yo gukina, equalizer, insanganyamatsiko, n\'ururimi ikunda.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_title">Amadosiye y\'umuziki</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_body">Amadosiye y\'amajwi ntabwo yinjizwa muri database ya porogaramu. Ongeraho amadosiye ya isomero hanyuma Retro Player igasoma amadosiye kuri disiki.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_title">Dosiye z\'urutonde rw\'ibitabo</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_body">Urutonde rw\'indirimbo ni dosiye zisanzwe za .m3u zibikwa muri dosiye zawe zo muri isomero. Ushobora kuzihindura muri porogaramu cyangwa ukoresheje uburyo ubwo aribwo bwose bwo guhindura inyandiko.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_title">Urubuga: %1$s</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_permissions_title">Uruhushya rwa Android n\'ububiko</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_native_body">Retro Player ibika ububiko bwayo bw\'amakuru mu gice cy\'ubufasha cya porogaramu-yigenga mu bubiko bw\'imbere. Amadosiye yawe y\'umuziki aguma mu madosiye uhisemo hamwe n\'igikoresho gitoranya amadosiye ya sisitemu.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_title">Gukina inyuma kuri Android</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_body">Iyo amajwi arimo aracurangwa, Retro Player ikoresha serivisi y’itangazamakuru imbere kugira ngo gukina bikomeze niba ufunze telefoni cyangwa uhinduye porogaramu, hamwe n’uburyo bwo gutwara abantu mu itangazo rya sisitemu. Gukuraho porogaramu kuri Recents bihagarika gukina kandi bikuraho itangazo.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_body_android">Amakuru ya porogaramu abikwa mu gice cy’ubufasha cya porogaramu-yigenga mu bubiko bw’imbere.</string>
